      "end": 581.64,
      "en": "Claim to have.",
      "zh": "声称拥有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 581.64,
      "end": 583.45,
      "en": "She claimed to have a baby or something.",
      "zh": "她声称有一个孩子什么的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 584.0,
      "end": 585.0,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 585.0,
      "end": 586.0,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 586.0,
      "end": 587.0,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 587.0,
      "end": 588.0,
      "en": "So let's move to our next phrase.",
      "zh": "所以让我们转到我们的下一个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 588.0,
      "end": 589.08,
      "en": "Under heavy.",
      "zh": "遭到猛烈攻击。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 589.08,
      "end": 589.64,
      "en": "Under heavy.",
      "zh": "遭到猛烈攻击。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 590.8,
      "end": 591.18,
      "en": "Under heavy.",
      "zh": "遭到猛烈攻击。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 591.84,
      "end": 594.44,
      "en": "So in the dialogue, they said we're under heavy attack.",
      "zh": "所以在对话中，他们说我们受到了猛烈的攻击。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 595.04,
      "end": 596.04,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 596.04,
      "end": 598.32,
      "en": "You can also use this phrase in a couple of other ways.",
      "zh": "您还可以通过其他几种方式使用此短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 600.96,
      "end": 601.96,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 601.96,
      "end": 608.8,
      "en": "We're under heavy attack.",
      "zh": "我们正遭受重创。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 608.8,
      "end": 609.1,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 611.88,
      "end": 612.59,
      "en": "We're under heavy fire.",
      "zh": "我们正处于猛烈的火力之下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 615.96,
      "end": 616.37,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 618.72,
      "end": 620.4,
      "en": "The prime minister is under heavy security.",
      "zh": "首相处于严密的安全之下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 622.96,
      "end": 624.97,
      "en": "So if you're under heavy fire.",
      "zh": "所以如果你在猛烈的火力下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 625.2,
      "end": 626.53,
      "en": "Means that there's a lot of fire.",
      "zh": "说明有很多火。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 626.84,
      "end": 627.19,
      "en": "Like gunfire.",
      "zh": "像枪火一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 627.84,
      "end": 628.25,
      "en": "Gunfire, yeah.",
      "zh": "枪火，是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 628.84,
      "end": 629.41,
      "en": "Yeah, not like fire fire.",
      "zh": "是的，不像火灾。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 629.84,
      "end": 630.84,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 630.84,
      "end": 631.84,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 631.84,
      "end": 633.8,
      "en": "And if you're under heavy security.",
      "zh": "如果你处于严格的安全状态。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 634.63,
      "end": 638.25,
      "en": "It means that you have a lot of security, a lot of bodyguards or a lot of.",
      "zh": "这意味着你有很多安全感，很多保镖或很多。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 638.25,
      "end": 638.75,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 639.4,
      "end": 642.12,
      "en": "Like a prime minister or president would be under heavy security.",
      "zh": "就像总理或总统将处于严密的安全之下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 642.12,
      "end": 643.12,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 643.12,
      "end": 644.12,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 644.12,
      "end": 645.28,
      "en": "A couple of great phrases.",
      "zh": "几个很棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 645.28,
      "end": 648.79,
      "en": "Really good phrases and with this, we can listen to our dialogue a third time.",
      "zh": "非常好的短语，有了这个，我们可以第三次听我们的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 649.4,
      "end": 655.68,
      "en": "Really, Fuzz, you can't take me to jail.",
      "zh": "真的，fuzz，你不能把我送进监狱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 655.68,
      "end": 659.8,
      "en": "Don't you know who I am?",
      "zh": "你不知道我是谁吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 659.8,
      "end": 662.8,
      "en": "Kris Kringle, you know.",
      "zh": "克里斯·克林格尔，你知道的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 662.8,
      "end": 667.04,
      "en": "Papa Noel, Père Noel, Baba Natale.",
      "zh": "帕帕·诺埃尔、佩尔·诺埃尔、巴博·纳塔莱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 667.04,
      "end": 668.28,
      "en": "Chantant l'Enfant.",
      "zh": "尚德·恩凡特。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 670.3,
      "end": 670.84,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 671.1,
      "end": 672.98,
      "en": "We've heard that one before, haven't we, Joe?",
      "zh": "我们以前听说过，不是吗，乔？"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 673.82,
      "end": 674.14,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 674.96,
      "end": 677.28,
      "en": "I even book this guy who claimed to be a tooth fairy.",
      "zh": "我什至预订了这个自称是牙仙子的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 677.28,
      "end": 677.84,
      "en": "Can you believe that?",
      "zh": "你能信吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 678.28,
      "end": 684.16,
      "en": "It's Christmas Eve and I have all these presents to deliver.",
      "zh": "这是平安夜，我有所有这些礼物要送。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 684.16,
      "end": 685.16,
      "en": "Where's your Christmas spirit?",
      "zh": "你们的圣诞精神呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 686.08,
      "end": 690.9,
      "en": "What will happen when all the children wake up tomorrow and don't find any gifts in their stockings?",
      "zh": "明天孩子们醒来，要是圣诞袜里没有礼物怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 691.36,
      "end": 694.32,
      "en": "Sorry, buddy, you're parked in a no parking zone.",
      "zh": "对不起，伙计，你停在没有停车区。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 694.32,
      "end": 697.64,
      "en": "You were speeding and you have no ID.",
      "zh": "你还超速，又没有身份证件。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 697.64,
      "end": 702.8,
      "en": "Besides that, even if we let you go now, your sleigh's been impounded and those reindeer were taken to the city zoo.",
      "zh": "而且，就算我们现在放你走，你的雪橇也已经被扣押，驯鹿都被送到市立动物园了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 703.84,
      "end": 705.56,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 705.56,
      "end": 706.16,
      "en": "This is unbelievable.",
      "zh": "太不可思议了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 707.32,
      "end": 708.98,
      "en": "What's this world coming to?",
      "zh": "这世道怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 709.8,
      "end": 711.96,
      "en": "Christmas is ruined.",
      "zh": "圣诞节毁了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 711.96,
      "end": 712.44,
      "en": "What's that up ahead?",
      "zh": "前面那是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 713.04,
      "end": 714.04,
      "en": "It looks like elves.",
      "zh": "看起来像是小精灵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 714.04,
      "end": 715.04,
      "en": "Whoa, they're shooting candy canes.",
      "zh": "哇，他们在拍棒棒糖。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 715.04,
      "end": 716.04,
      "en": "Mayday, mayday, we're under heavy attack.",
      "zh": "五月天，五月天，我们正遭受重创。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 716.04,
      "end": 717.04,
      "en": "We need backup.",
      "zh": "我们需要支援。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 732.2,
      "end": 736.16,
      "en": "So, Marco, the police mentioned something about the tooth fairy.",
      "zh": "所以，马可，警察提到了一些关于牙仙的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 736.72,
      "end": 737.42,
      "en": "The tooth fairy.",
      "zh": "牙仙子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 737.82,
      "end": 741.66,
      "en": "I don't know, maybe some of our listeners don't know this story about the tooth fairy.",
      "zh": "我不知道，也许我们的一些听众不知道这个关于牙仙的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 742.0,
      "end": 744.8,
      "en": "So can I go ahead and say it?",
      "zh": "那我可以继续说吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 744.8,
      "end": 745.3,
      "en": "Yes, go ahead.",
      "zh": "是的，继续。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 745.8,
      "end": 748.2,
      "en": "Okay, well, when you're small and you lose a tooth.",
      "zh": "好吧，当你很小，你掉了一颗牙时。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 748.76,
      "end": 749.14,
      "en": "Your baby teeth.",
      "zh": "你的乳牙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 749.76,
      "end": 753.04,
      "en": "Yeah, you put it underneath your pillow and then you go to sleep.",
      "zh": "是的，你把它放在枕头下面，然后你就去睡觉了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 754.32,
      "end": 762.96,
      "en": "And then in the night, the tooth fairy comes into the house, flies into the house, sneaks under your pillow, takes the tooth and puts money there.",
      "zh": "然后在夜里，牙仙子走进屋子，飞进屋里，偷偷摸摸枕头下，把牙拿到那里，把钱放在那里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 763.28,
      "end": 764.0,
      "en": "I see.",
      "zh": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 764.28,
      "end": 768.46,
      "en": "So this is a story that parents tell their kids about what happens to their baby teeth.",
      "zh": "所以这是一个父母告诉他们的孩子乳牙会发生什么的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 768.92,
      "end": 770.36,
      "en": "And they get money in exchange for it.",
      "zh": "他们得到钱来换取它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 770.36,
      "end": 771.36,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 771.36,
      "end": 773.08,
      "en": "So I guess it takes away the sadness of losing that tooth.",
      "zh": "所以我想它消除了失去那颗牙齿的悲伤。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 773.72,
      "end": 773.84,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 774.32,
      "end": 778.66,
      "en": "But in South America, for example, we have the tooth mouse.",
      "zh": "例如，在南美洲，我们有牙齿鼠标。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 779.14,
      "end": 779.9,
      "en": "The tooth mouse.",
      "zh": "牙老鼠。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 780.36,
      "end": 781.36,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 781.36,
      "end": 782.36,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 782.36,
      "end": 783.36,
      "en": "What is it?",
      "zh": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 783.36,
      "end": 784.36,
      "en": "How does it call them in Spanish?",
      "zh": "它用西班牙语怎么称呼他们？"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 784.36,
      "end": 786.58,
      "en": "Oh, well, in some places it's called Ratoncito Perez.",
      "zh": "哦，好吧，在某些地方，它被称为 Ratoncito Perez。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 787.72,
      "end": 789.04,
      "en": "Like it has a last name Perez.",
      "zh": "就像它有一个姓佩雷斯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 789.42,
      "end": 789.76,
      "en": "Oh, really?",
      "zh": "哦，真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 790.18,
      "end": 794.28,
      "en": "In other places, it's just called Ratoncito, which means mouse.",
      "zh": "在其他地方，它只是称为 Ratoncito，意思是鼠标。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 794.66,
      "end": 796.28,
      "en": "Okay, so it'd be like tooth fairy Smith.",
      "zh": "好吧，这就像牙仙子史密斯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 796.92,
      "end": 798.22,
      "en": "Yeah, tooth fairy Smith.",
      "zh": "是的，牙仙史密斯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 798.98,
      "end": 799.66,
      "en": "And it's the same thing.",
      "zh": "这是同样的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 799.84,
      "end": 804.08,
      "en": "It's a little mouse that comes in and steals a little tooth from you and leaves money in exchange.",
      "zh": "它是一只小老鼠，它可以从你身上偷走一颗小牙齿，并留下钱作为交换。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 804.88,
      "end": 805.08,
      "en": "Cool.",
      "zh": "真有意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 805.88,
      "end": 806.88,
      "en": "Very cool.",
      "zh": "真酷。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 806.88,
      "end": 807.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 807.88,
      "end": 811.32,
      "en": "So we go from Santa Claus to Guns and Wars to the tooth fairy.",
      "zh": "所以我们从圣诞老人到枪支，战争再到牙仙子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 811.32,
      "end": 811.86,
      "en": "Only at EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "只在Englishpod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 812.32,
      "end": 813.32,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 813.32,
      "end": 814.32,
      "en": "All right, guys.",
      "zh": "好了，各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 814.32,
      "end": 815.32,
      "en": "I hope you enjoyed today's lesson.",
      "zh": "我希望你喜欢今天的课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 815.84,
      "end": 820.92,
      "en": "If you have any questions or comments about the lesson, please visit our website, EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "如果您对本课程有任何疑问或意见，请访问我们的网站 englishpod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 820.92,
      "end": 821.92,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 322,
      "start": 822.18,
      "end": 822.92,
      "en": "Well, we're out of time.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们没时间了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 323,
      "start": 823.32,
      "end": 824.32,
      "en": "We got to go.",
      "zh": "我们得走了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 324,
      "start": 824.32,
      "end": 825.48,
      "en": "We've got some Christmas shopping to do.",
      "zh": "我们有一些圣诞购物要做。"
    },
    {
      "id": 325,
      "start": 825.76,
      "end": 826.42,
      "en": "Yes, Christmas shopping.",
      "zh": "是的，圣诞购物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 326,
      "start": 826.78,
      "end": 828.18,
      "en": "So we'll see you guys later.",
      "zh": "所以我们稍后再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 327,
      "start": 828.76,
      "end": 829.76,
      "en": "And until then, it's goodbye.",
      "zh": "在那之前，这是再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 328,
      "start": 829.76,
      "end": 834.76,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
